OL,3,A18 deaths from battery fires show
OL,4,Ahidden danger of UK's e-bike boom
OL,5,
OL,6,FEighteen people have died and nearly
OL,7,F700 have been injured in fires caused
OL,8,Fby e-bikes and e-scooters, new data
OL,9,Fshows.
OL,11,FFatalities recorded by fire and rescue
OL,12,Fservices across the UK from these fires
OL,13,Finclude cases where people became
OL,14,Ftrapped inside burning homes, died
OL,15,Fwhile trying to escape from a fire out
OL,16,Fof a high window, or from inhaling
OL,17,Ftoxic smoke.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
